{"title":"Career roadmap — Coastal Zone Analyst","role":"Coastal Zone Analyst","summary":"A Coastal Zone Analyst studies coastal environments and helps analyse shoreline change, coastal hazards, marine ecosystems, land-use patterns, erosion, flooding, pollution, and climate-related coastal risks.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Marine Science / Oceanography"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Oceanography","GIS/Remote Sensing","Environmental Science","Spatial Data","Climate Risk"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"It can lead to careers in government agencies, environmental consultancies, research institutes, coastal planning, marine conservation, infrastructure, disaster management, and climate-risk analysis."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Primary focus","Likely opportunities"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Oceanography, GIS, remote sensing, coastal processes"},{"text":"Coastal Zone Analyst, GIS Analyst, Research Assistant"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Coastal modelling, spatial analysis, climate-risk assessment"},{"text":"Senior Coastal Analyst, Coastal GIS Specialist"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Coastal planning, hazard modelling, project leadership"},{"text":"Coastal Scientist, Coastal Risk Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Climate adaptation, digital coastal systems, strategic planning"},{"text":"Coastal Resilience Lead, Marine/Climate Programme Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the B.Sc.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Marine science foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physical oceanography"},{"text":"Marine biology"},{"text":"Marine chemistry"},{"text":"Marine geology"},{"text":"Atmo