:"Add technical tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS/ArcGIS"},{"text":"Google Earth Engine"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"R"},{"text":"SQL/PostGIS"},{"text":"Raster processing"},{"text":"Remote-sensing workflows"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic coastal models where relevant:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hydrodynamic modelling"},{"text":"Wave modelling"},{"text":"Flood modelling"},{"text":"Sediment transport modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Honours/research route"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong dissertation could investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shoreline migration"},{"text":"Coastal erosion"},{"text":"Sea-level rise"},{"text":"Mangrove change"},{"text":"Coastal flooding"},{"text":"Cyclone vulnerability"},{"text":"Urban coastal expansion"},{"text":"Beach morphology"},{"text":"Coastal pollution"},{"text":"Blue-carbon ecosystems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core skill stack"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Oceanography"},{"text":"Waves, tides, currents, circulation"}],[{"text":"Coastal science"},{"text":"Erosion, sediment, geomorphology"}],[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"QGIS, ArcGIS, spatial analysis"}],[{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Satellite imagery, classification, change detection"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Statistics, Python, R"}],[{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"SQL, PostGIS"}],[{"text":"Climate"},{"text":"Sea-level rise, climate-risk assessment"}],[{"text":"Modelling"},{"text":"Flood, wave, hydrodynamic concepts"}],[{"text":"Fieldwork"},{"text":"GPS, sampling, surveying"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Maps, technical reports, policy briefs"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key skills","Career direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"Coastal GIS"},{"text":"GIS + spatial analysis"},{"text":"Coastal GIS Analyst"}],[{"text":"Remote Sensing"},{"text":"Satellite imagery + Earth observation"},{"text":"Coastal Remote-Sensing Analyst"}],[{"text":"Coastal Hazards